  "limitations": [
    "within-session temporal splits are correlated and do not establish generalization to a new run",
    "forward flag and 3s history are inputs, but forward speed/PWM and separate causal excitation are unavailable",
    "commanded PWM and estimated valves, not actual actuator feedback",
    "estimated acceleration has filter lag",
    "initial recorded MPC modulator phase and actuator lock are assumed; DAgger carries simulated controller/actuator state",
    "4s MPC extrapolates a dynamics model trained on 3s prediction windows",
    "domain randomization and DAgger samples are simulated, not validation of real operating conditions",
    "cost v2 fixes the actual-correction penalty and uses population ensemble variance; previous v1 cost numbers are not directly comparable"
  ]
